poetic_cot:
Insects breathe through stomata reaching a limit tied to our air,
So atmospheric oxygen levels cap how large these bugs can bear;
When Carboniferous oxygen soared to thirty-five percent long ago,
Giant dragonflies with one-meter wingspans proved this rule was so;
Thus history confirms the amount of oxygen determines insect size.

Software fixes errors, so schools think language skills can fade,
Assuming correct mechanics mean good writing has been made;
Yet avoiding vocabulary and grammar mistakes does not ensure quality,
So software cannot justify ignoring a student's Chinese ability;
Thus journalism schools must still teach language proficiency.

Equal deaths are claimed to show drug W is inert,
Yet Option Zero proves that death was still deferred;
The placebo group expired two prior years away,
So even without preventing death, the drug delayed decay;
Thus the proof of ineffectiveness melts entirely away.

When Tsinghua is tested as the champion team,
Professor Sun gets both predictions right, as they seem;
Professor Qian is wholly wrong on every count,
While Zhao is half correct in the amount;
Thus matching the given rules, the winner is clear.

Summing listed identities yields twelve instead of nine,
Showing passenger categories must overlap and combine;
Option two resolves this by noting overlaps are met,
Where two Chinese entrepreneurs and one lawyer-American jet;
Twelve minus two entrepreneurs minus one lawyer leaves nine.

Respect brings meticulous taste and moral grace,
While overbearing actions show a lack of place;
Plundering nature destroys our sustainable life ahead,
Linking immorality and overbearingness is what is said;
Thus coupling immorality with carefulness cannot be read.

Before the WTO, businesses asked how to make money,
Tying success directly to overall industry gains;
Now the question is solely how to be the best,
Where performance shifts from the whole sector to individual firms;
Thus what once was judged by the industry is now judged by the enterprise.

Four surveys show urban Beijing's obese kids grew for ten years straight,
While overall child population counts remained stable or did not abate;
Because the total sum comprises obese and non-obese children combined,
A rising obese group means non-obese kids must also increase in kind;
Thus, the number of non-obese children in Beijing has likewise continued to rise.

With F north of H, and G north of them all,
G is adjacent to E, preventing E's fall;
Since E cannot slide south of F, it rests north,
And adjacent I must precede E forth;
Thus I sits above F, answering the call.

In early times, but lightest gases grew,
While carbon needs a star's hot core to brew;
A nebula holds carbon formed of old,
When youth of space had 1.5 billions told;
Thus stars had formed before that time took place.

Challenges teach us deep self-knowledge when we watch our reactions grow,
While options missing trials or fears fail to reveal what we must know;
So facing public speaking fears lets one confront emotional strain,
Since only meeting trials head-on brings insight through the pain;
Thus choosing challenges to face is how true weakness comes to light.

The Chinese state waived all its claims,
So individual laborers lost their aims;
When colleges are banned from stocks,
Professor Zhang must yield to rules and locks;
A collective's rule on members falls.

Meaningful words provoke reactions through their sense,
While meaningless words provide the vital evidence;
This proves that word reactions do not depend on meaning alone,
For pronunciation's separate influence is thus shown;
Thus, meaningless words act as a premise for this claim.

Though experts predicted huge losses of cars returned,
Not a single return or replacement occurred;
Other factors fail to explain this complete absence,
As unworkable legal provisions block all such claims;
Thus impractical rules explain why zero refunds transpired.

General words live high where reason holds sway,
While raw, instinctual swear words are stored far away;
Strokes and Alzheimer's damage the rational upper sphere,
Leaving the lower emotional zones safe from that fear;
Thus primitive curses survive when all other language decays.

Aesthetic judgment starts subjective in the short term,
With varied evaluations of contemporary art;
Yet over centuries of time, these subjective factors fade,
As changing evaluations for the same art prove this shift;
Thus lasting joy reveals a truly great and objective work.

To satisfy real needs is government's true role,
And knowing those needs must precede meeting the goal;
Since speech brings demand to officials' attentive ear,
Free speech remains crucial for health to appear;
Though other needs matter, option zero leaves this core clear.

Without foreign help, Russia cannot revive its Far East land,
Yet outside labor risks alienation from the foreign hand;
To seek rejuvenation without relying on internal might,
Forces Russia to face this foreign alienation as a plight;
Thus seeking outside means to mend the region makes this risk stand.

Hot blocks cyclamen and dry kills rice each day,
While most lands grow just one of them instead;
If half were hot and dry, both crops would stay away,
Defying how most regions must forge ahead;
Thus half being dry and hot cannot be true.

With second spot secured by F, and seven slots in line,
We test which records starting first fulfill the rules divine;
While G, H, J, and K succeed by finding valid space,
L and M require prior tracks, forbidding them first place;
Thus G, H, J, and K alone may take the opening stage.

High milk standards cause farmers to add melamine to cope,
The 2008 scandal proved that standard led to this scope;
Thus looking at the outbreak to call the rule too high,
Repeats the flawed reverse-implication reasoning why;
Just as railway accidents incorrectly prove a management loophole by.

Every month brings a seasonal, festive, or dual promotion to sight,
Where at least one of these two forms must always take flight;
Thus, if the seasonal promotion fails to appear in the sky,
A holiday promotion must occur to satisfy the rule's strict tie;
So the absence of the first leaves the second as the required right.
